headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

docs {
  OJ Auto Detailing quote API.

  Switch environments to hit local dev (localhost:3001) or production (api.oj-auto-detailing.com.au).

  Valid services: touch-up, tier-1-exterior, tier-2-interior, tier-3-complete
  Valid addons: scratch-removal, trim-restoration, water-repellent, anti-fog, headlight-restoration
  Valid vehicle types: car, caravan
}
